    "subsystemType": "Hrot.Scenario",
    "schemaVersion": "1.0",
    "terrainName": "test-town",
    "description": "What: AQ96 C3 (CE-2319) - a six-man squad closes 120 m on two hostile riflemen by fire and movement: one half suppresses while the other rushes, then they swap (all immortal). Judge: (1) the rushing half runs CROUCHED at the rush speed; (2) a mover near-missed in the open drops prone and stops; (3) while the other half's fire covers his half he rises even though rounds still come (he does not wait for the fire on him to lapse), after a ~1.5 m sideways crawl; (4) the bounds still complete (the squad reaches the objective area). Compare uf-alone-under-fire, where the same fire keeps a lone man down. Check: python3 scripts/utility-demo-check.py --launch uf-squad-under-fire"
  },
